  "description": "Control lab instruments with SCPI, from .NET. Raw-socket, VXI-11 (LXI) and RS-232 serial transports, VISA resource strings, network and serial-port discovery, instrument identification, script and sequence runners, waveform and screenshot decoding — and 36 curated command catalogs holding 23,978 commands transcribed from the manufacturers' own programming guides: Rohde & Schwarz, Rigol, Siglent, Keysight, Chroma, B&K Precision, GW Instek, Keithley, Tektronix and Fluke oscilloscopes, multimeters, power supplies, electronic loads, signal generators and spectrum analyzers. No UI dependency; runs on Windows, Linux and macOS.",
